<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Şifremi Unuttum — CroShy Anı</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/img/logo-64.png" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/img/logo-192.png" />
<script>(function(){var m=document.cookie.match(/(?:^|; )croshy_theme=([^;]+)/);if(m&&/^[a-z]+$/.test(m[1]))document.documentElement.classList.add('theme-'+m[1]);})();</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="bg-blobs"><div class="blob b1"></div><div class="blob b2"></div></div>
  <div class="auth-page">
    <div class="auth-page-inner">
      <div class="auth-card">
        <div class="auth-head"><span class="brand-mark-wrap"><img src="/img/logo-192.png" alt="" /></span><span class="brand-text">CroShy Anı</span></div>
        <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-head); font-size:1.3rem; margin:0 0 6px;">🔑 Şifreni mi unuttun?</h1>
        <p class="profile-section-sub" style="margin:0 0 14px;">Kayıt olurken sana verilen <strong>kurtarma kodlarından</strong> birini gir. E-posta gerekmez.</p>
        <% if (error) { %><div class="auth-error"><%= error %></div><% } %>
        <% if (success) { %><div class="status-msg show ok" style="margin-bottom:12px;"><%= success %></div><% } %>
        <form method="POST" action="/forgot-password" class="auth-form" autocomplete="off">
          <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="Kullanıcı adı" value="<%= username %>" required />
          <input type="text" name="code" placeholder="Kurtarma kodu (XXXXX-XXXXX)" maxlength="14" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" required />
          <input type="password" name="newPassword" placeholder="Yeni şifre (en az 6 karakter)" minlength="6" autocomplete="new-password" required />
          <input type="password" name="confirmPassword" placeholder="Yeni şifre (tekrar)" minlength="6" autocomplete="new-password" required />
          <button type="submit" class="btn primary">Şifreyi Sıfırla</button>
        </form>
        <p class="auth-switch" style="margin-top:12px;"><a href="/login">← Girişe dön</a></p>
        <p class="auth-switch" style="font-size:.76rem;">Kodların yoksa ya da kayıpsa: sağ alttaki <strong>Geri Bildirim</strong> düğmesiyle yöneticiye yaz.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/feedback-widget.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/cookie-banner.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
